---
/**
 * CmsExplainer.astro — Plain-English explanation and application technical specifications.
 */
---

<section class="cms-explainer-section" id="what-is-a-cms-detector" aria-labelledby="explainer-h2">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="explainer-grid">
      <!-- Left: Plain-English Explainer -->
      <div class="explainer-card">
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="eyebrow-lockup">
            <span class="eyebrow type-mono-eyebrow text-mute">Overview</span>
            <h2 id="explainer-h2" class="section-title">
              What Is a CMS Detector?
            </h2>
          </div>
          <p class="explainer-text">
            A <strong>CMS detector</strong> is an online tool that identifies the content management system or website builder powering any site—such as WordPress, Shopify, Webflow, Squarespace, or headless platforms—without requiring private admin credentials.
          </p>
          <p class="explainer-text" style="margin-block-start: 12px;">
            Just like a web browser, it reads publicly available technical clues transmitted by the web server. By analyzing page markup, script directories, stylesheet paths, and HTTP response headers, it instantly reveals the underlying technologies that power the website.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="explainer-footer">
          <div class="feature-tag">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tag-icon" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>100% Non-Invasive</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-tag">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tag-icon" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Public Clues Only</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-tag">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tag-icon" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Zero Data Storage</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Technical Info on CMS Detector AI -->
      <div class="explainer-card tech-card">
        <div class="card-top-bar">
          <div class="eyebrow-lockup" style="margin-block-end: 0;">
            <span class="eyebrow type-mono-eyebrow text-mute">Application Architecture</span>
            <h3 class="tech-title">
              Our Engine & Specifications
            </h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-spec-list">
          <div class="tech-spec-item">
            <span class="tech-spec-key">Runtime</span>
            <span class="tech-spec-val">Cloudflare Workers (Edge V8)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-spec-item">
            <span class="tech-spec-key">Inspection Model</span>
            <span class="tech-spec-val">Passive read-only HTTP/2</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-spec-item">
            <span class="tech-spec-key">Scoring Engine</span>
            <span class="tech-spec-val">Multi-signal Noisy-OR confidence</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-spec-item">
            <span class="tech-spec-key">Security Guards</span>
            <span class="tech-spec-val">RFC 1918 SSRF & private IP filter</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-spec-item">
            <span class="tech-spec-key">Streaming Budget</span>
            <span class="tech-spec-val">500KB cap · 5s subrequest timeout</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-spec-item">
            <span class="tech-spec-key">Data Privacy</span>
            <span class="tech-spec-val">0% logging · Ephemeral memory only</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cms-explainer-section {
    padding-block: clamp(36px, 4vw, 52px);
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--color-hairline-soft);
  }

  .explainer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .explainer-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  .explainer-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(28, 28, 32, 0.6) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.75) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-marketing);
    padding: clamp(22px, 2.8vw, 30px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .tech-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22, 22, 26, 0.8) 0%, rgba(14, 14, 16, 0.95) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
  }

  .eyebrow-lockup {
    margin-block-end: 14px;
  }

  .section-title {
    color: var(--color-on-primary);
    margin-block: 6px 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 26px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .tech-title {
    color: var(--color-on-primary);
    margin-block: 4px 0;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 20px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .explainer-text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(14.5px, 1.6vw, 15.5px);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-ash);
  }

  .explainer-text strong {
    color: var(--color-on-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .explainer-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-block-start: 22px;
    padding-block-start: 16px;
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .feature-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-app-sm);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: var(--color-ash);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .tag-icon {
    color: var(--color-success);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Right Card / Technical Specs */
  .card-top-bar {
    margin-block-end: 18px;
  }

  .tech-spec-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .tech-spec-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: var(--radius-app-sm);
  }

  .tech-spec-key {
    color: var(--color-mute);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .tech-spec-val {
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-align: right;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .tech-spec-item {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 3px;
    }
    .tech-spec-val {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
